WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.840
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.110 --> 01:44.000
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.100 --> 01:46.890
[Episode 27]

4
02:07.000 --> 02:07.640
Who is it?

5
02:10.560 --> 02:11.470
P-President.

6
02:11.960 --> 02:12.890
President Long.

7
02:13.630 --> 02:16.310
I heard you two are together.

8
02:16.630 --> 02:17.360
-Yes. -Yes.

9
02:18.870 --> 02:19.930
Congratulations.

10
02:25.000 --> 02:26.400
I want to talk to Liu Zhengliang

11
02:26.400 --> 02:27.520
alone.

12
02:28.310 --> 02:29.190
Is that okay?

13
02:29.910 --> 02:30.870
Alone, right?

14
02:32.030 --> 02:33.470
Then I... I should go out.

15
02:35.590 --> 02:36.360
Okay.

16
02:36.360 --> 02:38.000
Wait, I'll put on a mink coat.

17
02:38.030 --> 02:38.829
It's too cold.

18
02:42.750 --> 02:43.430
Go ahead and talk.

19
02:43.430 --> 02:43.870
Sorry.

20
02:43.870 --> 02:44.960
It's fine. No big deal.

21
02:44.960 --> 02:46.490
You... wait for me a moment.

22
02:46.630 --> 02:48.490
Don't leave. Wait for me a moment.

23
02:49.030 --> 02:49.960
Come in. Come in.

24
02:52.840 --> 02:53.630
Have a seat.

25
03:06.680 --> 03:07.470
It's good.

26
03:09.310 --> 03:10.840
Having someone by your side

27
03:10.840 --> 03:12.170
makes me feel relieved.

28
03:23.310 --> 03:24.370
Careful, it's hot.

29
03:25.430 --> 03:26.630
Let's sit for a while.

30
03:26.630 --> 03:27.590
I won't sit.

31
03:27.590 --> 03:28.430
I've been sitting all day.

32
03:28.430 --> 03:29.870
It's good to stand for a while.

33
03:29.870 --> 03:31.150
I find that no matter how you change,

34
03:31.150 --> 03:33.520
you are always so awkward.

35
03:36.150 --> 03:37.150
Where were you?

36
03:39.190 --> 03:40.520
Are you really leaving?

37
03:42.000 --> 03:43.190
How did you guess?

38
03:43.470 --> 03:44.730
Do I even need to guess?

39
03:45.280 --> 03:47.280
Otherwise, you wouldn't have disappeared for so long,

40
03:47.280 --> 03:49.540
nor would you have come to me at this time.

41
03:50.310 --> 03:51.120
Not bad.

42
03:51.590 --> 03:52.590
You've made progress.

43
03:52.590 --> 03:53.960
Hanging out with me wasn't for nothing.

44
03:53.960 --> 03:54.910
I fall for your tricks every day,

45
03:54.910 --> 03:56.400
and they're always different.

46
03:56.400 --> 03:57.630
After being fooled for so long,

47
03:57.630 --> 03:58.630
I can also summarize

48
03:58.630 --> 03:59.630
some patterns.

49
04:00.120 --> 04:01.720
Why do you hold such a grudge?

50
04:02.430 --> 04:03.470
Tell me the truth.

51
04:04.630 --> 04:05.400
Actually, I'm not that bad,

52
04:05.400 --> 04:06.360
am I?

53
04:08.520 --> 04:09.560
Just so-so.

54
04:15.800 --> 04:17.399
Where are you planning to go?

55
04:18.870 --> 04:20.160
I got a small RV.

56
04:20.480 --> 04:21.310
I'm taking my wife

57
04:21.310 --> 04:22.800
to head south all the way

58
04:23.270 --> 04:25.000
and travel around the country.

59
04:25.630 --> 04:27.630
Drive anywhere and sleep anywhere.

60
04:27.630 --> 04:28.750
Free and easy,

61
04:29.390 --> 04:31.240
leisurely and carefree.

62
04:31.480 --> 04:32.270
Yes.

63
04:32.470 --> 04:33.720
You're free now,

64
04:33.720 --> 04:35.040
but what about Xiaoximen Hospital?

65
04:35.040 --> 04:36.000
It's your say now.

66
04:36.000 --> 04:37.530
It has nothing to do with me.

67
04:38.240 --> 04:39.040
I'm not the president anymore.

68
04:39.040 --> 04:40.800
How does it have nothing to do with you?

69
04:40.800 --> 04:41.560
If it weren't for you,

70
04:41.560 --> 04:42.040
well,

71
04:42.600 --> 04:45.530
Xiaoximen Hospital would have closed down long ago.

72
04:55.190 --> 04:58.050
I've already talked it over with the headquarters.

73
04:59.240 --> 05:00.510
Retiring at this point in time

74
05:00.510 --> 05:01.870
is also in the plan.

75
05:03.720 --> 05:05.040
My departure might be more beneficial

76
05:05.040 --> 05:07.440
to the development of Xiaoximen Hospital.

77
05:10.920 --> 05:11.680
That's true.

78
05:12.390 --> 05:13.720
You're getting old.

79
05:13.830 --> 05:14.600
It's time to retire.

80
05:14.600 --> 05:15.530
I'll beat you up!

81
05:17.000 --> 05:18.660
Can't you say something nice?

82
05:19.600 --> 05:20.390
What's nice?

83
05:21.600 --> 05:23.000
What do you want me to say?

84
05:24.630 --> 05:26.510
You don't want me to make a statement, do you?

85
05:26.510 --> 05:27.430
Let me tell you,

86
05:27.920 --> 05:29.040
it's absolutely impossible for me

87
05:29.040 --> 05:31.000
to be tied down to Xiaoximen Hospital.

88
05:31.000 --> 05:31.800
As long as there's any problem,

89
05:31.800 --> 05:32.630
I'll leave immediately.

90
05:32.630 --> 05:33.600
Even if there's no problem,

91
05:33.600 --> 05:34.730
you can still leave.

92
05:36.000 --> 05:37.870
I came just to tell you this.

93
05:41.720 --> 05:43.250
Even if Xiaoximen Hospital

94
05:44.040 --> 05:45.270
is doing fine,

95
05:45.270 --> 05:46.400
if you want to leave,

96
05:46.630 --> 05:48.040
you can leave anytime.

97
05:49.070 --> 05:51.400
You don't need to consider other factors.

98
05:54.159 --> 05:55.360
You came over just to tell me this?

99
05:55.360 --> 05:56.070
Yes.

100
06:01.120 --> 06:02.360
About what the future of Xiaoximen Hospital

101
06:02.360 --> 06:03.560
will exactly be like,

102
06:04.920 --> 06:07.160
only time can give the answer.

103
06:08.680 --> 06:10.940
You don't need to blame yourself either.

104
06:12.000 --> 06:13.480
What do I have to blame myself for?

105
06:13.480 --> 06:15.140
What does it have to do with me?

106
06:16.390 --> 06:17.850
If you can think like that,

107
06:18.070 --> 06:19.040
I'm relieved.

108
06:19.160 --> 06:19.950
I'm leaving.

109
06:22.120 --> 06:23.050
President Long.

110
06:30.830 --> 06:32.090
Fasten your seatbelt.

111
06:47.400 --> 06:53.420
[Hospital Admission Registration]

112
06:50.130 --> 06:53.500
♪ The melting snow and the warm wind ♪

113
06:53.690 --> 06:55.990
♪ The flowers bloom again ♪

114
06:55.680 --> 06:56.360
President.

115
06:56.430 --> 06:57.040
Well,

116
06:57.040 --> 06:58.430
I came specifically to find you.

117
06:57.260 --> 07:03.140
♪ It's spring; it's a remedy ♪

118
06:58.430 --> 06:59.510
For the new department—

119
06:59.510 --> 07:00.970
Comrade Huang Dongsheng.

120
07:04.000 --> 07:06.430
I'll leave Xiaoximen Hospital to you.

121
07:04.950 --> 07:08.530
♪ Stop and go, travelling separately ♪

122
07:08.830 --> 07:10.990
♪ At the next intersection ♪

123
07:12.430 --> 07:14.170
♪ You and I ♪

124
07:13.630 --> 07:14.360
No, no, no!

125
07:14.360 --> 07:15.310
Long, don't leave it to me!

126
07:15.310 --> 07:16.040
Really, I can't do it!

127
07:16.040 --> 07:16.870
Really, really!

128
07:16.070 --> 07:18.630
♪ Travel light ♪

129
07:16.870 --> 07:18.240
No, this is too tiring!

130
07:19.260 --> 07:23.870
[Hospital Admission Registration]

131
07:20.030 --> 07:26.140
♪ Put the past weighing on my back into the moon ♪

132
07:27.500 --> 07:32.600
♪ Longing makes me wake up ♪

133
07:29.120 --> 07:29.830
Long!

134
07:30.390 --> 07:31.240
Long!

135
07:32.310 --> 07:33.190
Long!

136
07:33.460 --> 07:37.320
♪ To the open window♪

137
07:33.630 --> 07:34.510
Long!

138
07:35.120 --> 07:36.190
Long, wait for me!

139
07:36.630 --> 07:37.760
Where are you going?

140
07:38.140 --> 07:44.650
♪ Softly, the person in my dream is like the moonlight ♪

141
07:38.600 --> 07:39.510
Long!

142
07:39.870 --> 07:40.680
Long!

143
07:44.480 --> 07:45.830
Quite the presence.

144
07:45.350 --> 07:49.510
♪ Falling on my heart softly and taking me ♪

145
07:47.720 --> 07:48.040
Huang.

146
07:48.040 --> 07:49.120
Long, wait for me!

147
07:49.630 --> 07:50.510
Where are you going?

148
07:49.750 --> 07:52.310
♪ To our old familiar place ♪

149
07:50.980 --> 07:52.950
[Emergency]

150
07:51.310 --> 07:52.070
Long!

151
07:53.010 --> 07:59.380
♪ Slowly, the petals fall to the center of the lake when I miss you ♪

152
07:53.190 --> 07:53.950
Long!

153
07:54.270 --> 07:55.920
Where are you going, Long? Long!

154
07:55.920 --> 07:57.000
Long, stop the car!

155
07:57.040 --> 07:57.870
Long!

156
07:58.070 --> 07:58.920
Long!

157
08:00.280 --> 08:04.350
♪ Ripples echo through the years, with our shadows facing each other ♪

158
08:03.270 --> 08:04.110
He's running fast.

159
08:04.110 --> 08:07.480
[Xiaoximen Hospital Affiliated with Qikang Medical]

160
08:04.730 --> 08:09.890
♪ We were together on the way we came ♪

161
08:18.480 --> 08:19.480
Big Pomegranate.

162
08:29.510 --> 08:30.120
Mr. Wang.

163
08:31.950 --> 08:32.880
Let me come back.

164
08:33.080 --> 08:34.210
I'll sing anything.

165
08:40.270 --> 08:41.150
I'm back.

166
08:51.600 --> 08:53.720
Welcome home, homeowner.

167
08:55.480 --> 08:57.510
Where did you get this outfit?

168
08:57.510 --> 08:58.270
How is it?

169
08:58.790 --> 09:00.240
I went for a job interview.

170
09:00.240 --> 09:01.270
You applied to be a security guard?

171
09:01.270 --> 09:02.120
You bet.

172
09:02.670 --> 09:04.730
Many companies were fighting for me.

173
09:05.120 --> 09:06.840
I beat a bunch of old men

174
09:06.910 --> 09:08.110
and young and middle-aged people.

175
09:08.110 --> 09:08.960
They took a fancy to me.

176
09:08.960 --> 09:10.120
I'm tall and give a sense of security.

177
09:10.120 --> 09:10.790
Look at me.

178
09:10.960 --> 09:11.510
Wait.

179
09:11.510 --> 09:11.910
How is it?

180
09:11.910 --> 09:13.840
Why did you apply for that?

181
09:14.750 --> 09:16.320
To earn more money

182
09:17.000 --> 09:18.400
and lighten your burden.

183
10:08.630 --> 10:09.480
Mingming.

184
10:10.720 --> 10:11.510
Come here.

185
10:16.320 --> 10:17.580
Do you still remember?

186
10:20.320 --> 10:21.120
Yes, I do.

187
10:29.630 --> 10:31.030
Was I handsome back then?

188
10:32.550 --> 10:34.010
You're not bad now either.

189
10:37.550 --> 10:39.750
You look more and more like your mother.

190
10:39.870 --> 10:41.400
Look how beautiful she was.

191
10:44.320 --> 10:46.520
More than 20 years have passed. So fast.

192
10:49.750 --> 10:50.550
Yes.

193
10:52.080 --> 10:53.610
I'm already in my thirties.

194
10:59.910 --> 11:01.200
I've kept this photo

195
11:01.200 --> 11:02.080
since then.

196
11:05.080 --> 11:06.540
I never dared to look at it.

197
11:08.240 --> 11:09.770
I was afraid when I saw it...

198
11:14.320 --> 11:15.650
I'd think of your mother

199
11:15.750 --> 11:16.720
and how she left.

200
11:19.550 --> 11:21.080
When I saw it, I thought of

201
11:25.080 --> 11:26.550
when I was laid off,

202
11:26.550 --> 11:27.550
how miserable

203
11:28.030 --> 11:29.030
and useless I was.

204
11:33.630 --> 11:35.090
So many years have passed.

205
11:39.320 --> 11:40.840
Just like this photo,

206
11:42.630 --> 11:44.120
I threw myself into it

207
11:46.200 --> 11:47.400
and couldn't get out.

208
11:54.080 --> 11:54.870
I know.

209
12:03.550 --> 12:05.510
Beijing is really a magical place.

210
12:09.120 --> 12:11.120
I used to be like in a dream.

211
12:14.120 --> 12:16.480
A trip to Beijing woke me up.

212
12:18.720 --> 12:19.630
I woke up.

213
12:26.080 --> 12:27.150
Don't worry.

214
12:30.510 --> 12:31.840
Our days ahead

215
12:33.120 --> 12:34.720
will definitely get better.

216
13:31.510 --> 13:32.270
My girl,

217
13:34.750 --> 13:36.550
you've worked hard these years.

218
13:53.260 --> 13:58.800
[Little Pepper Stage]

219
14:20.060 --> 14:23.100
[Xiaoximen Hospital Affiliated with Qikang Medical]

220
14:23.790 --> 14:24.840
Is my illness serious?

221
14:24.840 --> 14:25.870
How long have you noticed this?

222
14:25.870 --> 14:26.670
Over 2 months.

223
14:26.670 --> 14:28.390
Why did you wait over 2 months to see a doctor?

224
14:28.390 --> 14:29.480
Have you seen Liu?

225
14:30.320 --> 14:31.580
He's in the break room.

226
14:32.470 --> 14:34.470
At that time, because of the pain...

227
14:34.720 --> 14:36.580
You came because of the headache?

228
14:37.030 --> 14:37.840
Liu.

229
14:38.270 --> 14:39.480
I have a tricky patient upstairs.

230
14:39.480 --> 14:40.790
Go up and take a look for me.

231
14:40.790 --> 14:41.320
Let's go.

232
15:08.030 --> 15:09.120
Hurry, hurry!

233
15:09.200 --> 15:10.390
Please stop!

234
15:10.440 --> 15:11.150
Stop!

235
15:12.440 --> 15:14.670
This is too fast! Stop!

236
15:17.670 --> 15:19.120
Come, sit.

237
15:19.210 --> 15:22.670
[Health Knowledge Promotion]

238
15:20.030 --> 15:21.120
Let me introduce you.

239
15:21.120 --> 15:21.840
This

240
15:21.840 --> 15:23.550
is the one I just mentioned to you,

241
15:22.730 --> 15:23.460
[Expert Medical Care, Safeguarding Public Health]

242
15:23.550 --> 15:25.680
Liu Zhengliang, Chief Physician Liu.

243
15:26.320 --> 15:27.520
Chief Physician Liu?

244
15:27.600 --> 15:28.390
Yes.

245
15:28.840 --> 15:30.000
Don't let his youth fool you.

246
15:30.000 --> 15:31.240
He is the best doctor

247
15:31.240 --> 15:32.840
in our hospital's Neurosurgical Department.

248
15:32.840 --> 15:33.670
That's great.

249
15:33.870 --> 15:35.080
With Chief Physician Liu here,

250
15:35.080 --> 15:36.540
you're definitely saved.

251
15:41.670 --> 15:43.000
Have you experienced any mental blocks

252
15:43.000 --> 15:44.270
or logical gaps?

253
15:44.270 --> 15:44.870
Yes.

254
15:46.080 --> 15:48.610
When was the first time you had a mental block?

255
15:49.750 --> 15:51.750
Tell Chief Physician Liu yourself.

256
15:58.080 --> 16:00.440
I teach math

257
16:00.840 --> 16:02.170
at a junior high school.

258
16:03.120 --> 16:05.360
Last month, while I was teaching,

259
16:05.670 --> 16:06.670
I suddenly couldn't remember

260
16:06.670 --> 16:08.150
a very basic formula.

261
16:09.670 --> 16:11.600
I was standing on the podium at the time,

262
16:11.600 --> 16:13.120
facing my students.

263
16:14.120 --> 16:15.840
I couldn't say a single word.

264
16:16.270 --> 16:18.930
I was so anxious that my hands and feet went cold.

265
16:19.320 --> 16:21.320
I didn't know what was wrong with me.

266
16:22.960 --> 16:23.910
Go on.

267
16:24.360 --> 16:25.600
Tell Chief Physician Liu again

268
16:25.600 --> 16:27.120
what you just told me.

269
16:28.960 --> 16:29.910
Another time,

270
16:30.240 --> 16:31.640
a student made a mistake.

271
16:32.030 --> 16:33.760
I wanted to talk to his parents.

272
16:34.750 --> 16:35.790
Suddenly,

273
16:36.270 --> 16:37.840
I didn't know what to say.

274
16:38.270 --> 16:39.030
It was like,

275
16:40.270 --> 16:41.360
in my heart,

276
16:41.360 --> 16:42.760
I knew what I wanted to do.

277
16:43.120 --> 16:43.870
And in my head,

278
16:43.870 --> 16:44.930
there were images.

279
16:46.480 --> 16:48.410
But I just couldn't say it out loud.

280
16:48.670 --> 16:50.200
How often does this happen?

281
16:50.360 --> 16:53.870
About once a month on average.

282
16:54.790 --> 16:55.870
But I feel like

283
16:56.480 --> 16:58.270
the frequency is increasing.

284
16:59.840 --> 17:01.150
This is a typical manifestation

285
17:01.150 --> 17:02.600
of a tumor compressing

286
17:02.600 --> 17:04.920
language-associated functional areas.

287
17:04.920 --> 17:05.720
Chief Physician Liu,

288
17:05.720 --> 17:06.780
it's a brain tumor?

289
17:07.550 --> 17:08.680
What should we do?

290
17:10.640 --> 17:12.109
Don't be too nervous.

291
17:13.270 --> 17:15.000
Low-grade gliomas

292
17:15.030 --> 17:16.480
grow very slowly.

293
17:16.480 --> 17:17.609
How do we treat this?

294
17:17.680 --> 17:19.079
Does it require surgery?

295
17:20.200 --> 17:21.660
Whether to operate or not,

296
17:21.920 --> 17:23.650
there are pros and cons to each.

297
17:24.069 --> 17:25.800
With conservative treatment,

298
17:25.829 --> 17:27.680
you'll need regular MRI scans.

299
17:28.030 --> 17:29.400
The advantage is that you can avoid

300
17:29.400 --> 17:30.720
the risks of surgery.

301
17:33.030 --> 17:34.350
It's snowing!

302
17:35.310 --> 17:36.550
It's snowing!

303
17:41.160 --> 17:43.750
Are you surprised?

304
17:44.160 --> 17:45.830
The difficulty of the surgery

305
17:46.160 --> 17:47.680
is that while removing the tumor,

306
17:47.680 --> 17:50.110
we must protect your language ability

307
17:50.240 --> 17:51.370
from being damaged.

308
17:51.830 --> 17:52.480
That is to say,

309
17:52.480 --> 17:53.510
when the surgery reaches

310
17:53.510 --> 17:54.680
a critical stage,

311
17:54.680 --> 17:55.830
we need to wake you up

312
17:56.880 --> 17:58.270
and perform real-time language tests

313
17:58.270 --> 17:59.530
during the operation.

314
17:59.720 --> 18:01.650
This surgery is indeed not simple.

315
18:02.270 --> 18:03.030
In Fucheng,

316
18:03.030 --> 18:04.240
no one did it before.

317
18:05.030 --> 18:05.960
Until last year,

318
18:07.000 --> 18:08.070
Chief Physician Liu performed it

319
18:08.070 --> 18:09.730
on his brother successfully.

320
18:15.200 --> 18:15.960
Then...

321
18:16.750 --> 18:19.310
is there any risk in this surgery?

322
18:19.640 --> 18:21.100
Of course there are risks.

323
18:22.550 --> 18:23.880
As long as it's a surgery,

324
18:23.880 --> 18:25.210
there is a risk of death.

325
18:26.240 --> 18:27.590
And in your case,

326
18:27.830 --> 18:29.110
even with surgery,

327
18:29.310 --> 18:30.920
there is a risk of losing

328
18:30.920 --> 18:32.200
your language function.

329
18:32.200 --> 18:33.070
Chief Physician Liu,

330
18:33.070 --> 18:34.070
I beg you to do your best

331
18:34.070 --> 18:35.240
to save our Wang Bao.

332
18:35.240 --> 18:36.040
Stop talking.

333
18:39.550 --> 18:40.410
How about this?

334
18:40.720 --> 18:42.590
You go back and think about it carefully,

335
18:42.590 --> 18:44.190
and consider it thoroughly.

336
18:44.920 --> 18:46.070
I... I understand.

337
18:48.240 --> 18:49.370
I'll think about it.

338
18:56.500 --> 18:58.270
[Emergency Resuscitation]

339
18:57.640 --> 18:58.680
Hurry up. Get in the car.

340
18:58.270 --> 18:58.690
[Stroke Center] [Rapid Stroke Pathway] [Entrance]

341
19:03.850 --> 19:07.660
[Emergency]

342
19:06.830 --> 19:09.290
What kind of business is your brother doing?

343
19:09.350 --> 19:10.400
He's kept it a secret for so long

344
19:10.400 --> 19:12.200
and insisted we come and see.

345
19:12.590 --> 19:14.070
Don't ask me. I don't know.

346
19:15.350 --> 19:16.270
Do you know?

347
19:16.830 --> 19:18.270
How would I know?

348
19:18.480 --> 19:20.110
He's being all mysterious.

349
19:20.440 --> 19:22.270
Could it be some illegal business?

350
19:22.270 --> 19:23.830
No way. No way.

351
19:23.960 --> 19:25.160
Jia Xin is with him.

352
19:25.440 --> 19:27.100
He wouldn't scam his friends.

353
19:30.190 --> 19:35.350
[Xinguang Script Roleplay Club]

354
19:34.510 --> 19:35.400
This guy's outfit

355
19:35.400 --> 19:37.660
looks like he's performing at a funeral.

356
19:40.000 --> 19:41.000
It's real.

357
19:41.270 --> 19:43.070
Xinguang Script Roleplay Club?

358
19:44.030 --> 19:44.830
What is this place for?

359
19:44.830 --> 19:45.750
Acting?

360
19:45.880 --> 19:47.350
We have experience in acting.

361
19:47.350 --> 19:48.680
We acted in Bengbu.

362
19:48.680 --> 19:49.510
Alright. Don't mention that.

363
19:49.510 --> 19:50.680
You two have acted before?

364
19:50.680 --> 19:51.270
When you were acting,

365
19:51.270 --> 19:52.240
you weren't embarrassed.

366
19:52.240 --> 19:53.550
Did you perform surgery in the play?

367
19:53.550 --> 19:55.110
He charged forward with a gun,

368
19:55.110 --> 19:56.510
yelling at the top of his lungs.

369
19:55.350 --> 19:57.900
[A horrifying experience]

370
19:56.920 --> 19:58.000
With a bayonet.

371
20:00.310 --> 20:01.440
Look at this little wall lamp.

372
20:01.440 --> 20:02.440
We're here,

373
20:02.440 --> 20:05.100
and Zhengguang didn't even come out to greet us.

374
20:05.480 --> 20:06.590
He must be busy.

375
20:10.030 --> 20:11.000
Liu Zhengguang.

376
20:14.200 --> 20:15.070
This room?

377
20:22.680 --> 20:23.830
I'm scared to death. I'm scared to death.

378
20:23.830 --> 20:24.680
Alright, alright.

379
20:24.680 --> 20:25.350
Put it away. Put it away.

380
20:25.350 --> 20:26.440
It's quite a hassle.

381
20:26.440 --> 20:27.240
These bricks.

382
20:33.310 --> 20:34.680
Alright, I'll go first.

383
20:35.400 --> 20:36.310
It startled me.

384
20:36.400 --> 20:37.860
This is fake. This is fake.

385
20:41.510 --> 20:42.510
This is quite big.

386
20:52.640 --> 20:53.440
Let's go that way.

387
20:53.440 --> 20:54.640
There's no road here.

388
20:57.440 --> 20:58.590
It looks quite real.

389
20:59.590 --> 21:00.400
How come...

390
21:01.030 --> 21:01.510
Come on, you.

391
21:01.510 --> 21:02.510
You go first this time.

392
21:02.510 --> 21:04.640
They always scare me. What's going on?

393
21:05.680 --> 21:06.550
You go first.

394
21:15.750 --> 21:17.510
You two, just forget it.

395
21:20.720 --> 21:21.830
Come on, you both go first.

396
21:21.830 --> 21:22.830
Come on, go first.

397
21:24.270 --> 21:25.600
My tears are about to...

398
21:25.920 --> 21:26.830
I'm not here to play with you two.

399
21:26.830 --> 21:28.230
They're playing with me.

400
21:29.400 --> 21:31.200
-This is your wedding house. -Zhengguang!

401
21:31.200 --> 21:31.750
Right?

402
21:31.750 --> 21:32.680
Where did he go?

403
21:32.720 --> 21:34.550
Is this the bridal chamber for you two?

404
21:34.550 --> 21:35.750
Don't talk nonsense.

405
21:35.750 --> 21:37.350
I'll test the bed for you two.

406
21:37.680 --> 21:38.510
Look.

407
21:39.680 --> 21:40.270
How nice.

408
21:40.310 --> 21:41.110
Don't break it.

409
21:41.110 --> 21:42.510
Wishing you a little one soon.

410
21:42.510 --> 21:43.110
How is it?

411
21:44.030 --> 21:44.830
What's wrong?

412
21:45.270 --> 21:46.070
Are you okay?

413
21:46.920 --> 21:47.790
How is it?

414
21:48.200 --> 21:48.930
Are you okay?

415
21:53.240 --> 21:54.700
Are you okay? Are you okay?

416
21:55.400 --> 21:56.030
Bro?

417
21:56.110 --> 21:57.480
I have to remember

418
21:57.480 --> 21:58.920
not to get too close to the customers,

419
21:58.920 --> 22:00.350
or I'll easily get beaten up.

420
22:00.350 --> 22:01.160
Come on.

421
22:01.310 --> 22:01.960
Is it scary?

422
22:01.960 --> 22:03.760
Don't panic when things happen.

423
22:04.000 --> 22:05.440
Post it to Moments first.

424
22:05.440 --> 22:06.270
Is it scary?

425
22:08.000 --> 22:09.400
Where is Liu Zhengguang?

426
22:09.640 --> 22:10.570
Liu Zhengguang!

427
22:11.160 --> 22:11.590
Here!

428
22:13.240 --> 22:13.960
Jia Xin

429
22:14.270 --> 22:15.240
is this story's

430
22:15.240 --> 22:16.100
ultimate boss.

431
22:16.640 --> 22:17.680
This character

432
22:17.680 --> 22:19.590
is very, very deep.

433
22:19.880 --> 22:20.880
Here's the thing.

434
22:22.550 --> 22:23.880
On their wedding night,

435
22:23.960 --> 22:25.360
the husband took a candle

436
22:25.400 --> 22:27.200
while lifting her veil

437
22:27.270 --> 22:28.680
to create some atmosphere.

438
22:28.680 --> 22:29.480
When he lifted the veil,

439
22:29.480 --> 22:30.880
he set it on fire.

440
22:31.590 --> 22:32.920
This husband was very rich

441
22:32.920 --> 22:33.880
and bought her

442
22:33.880 --> 22:36.030
a silk wedding dress.

443
22:36.350 --> 22:37.590
As a result, from head to toe,

444
22:37.590 --> 22:38.440
she was completely burned.

445
22:38.440 --> 22:39.030
Too tragic.

446
22:39.030 --> 22:39.680
She was burned to death.

447
22:39.680 --> 22:41.680
It's about reasonably integrating

448
22:41.830 --> 22:44.720
Chinese horror elements

449
22:44.790 --> 22:46.240
with the scene of a modern dangerous building.

450
22:46.240 --> 22:48.510
This story is quite poignant.

451
22:49.680 --> 22:50.880
W-Who wrote it?

452
22:51.270 --> 22:52.070
Me.

453
22:52.350 --> 22:53.000
You?

454
22:53.000 --> 22:53.830
Who else but him

455
22:53.830 --> 22:55.510
-could write such a story? -He must have written it.

456
22:55.510 --> 22:57.000
You're quite talented, bro!

457
22:57.000 --> 22:57.960
Make it into a movie.

458
22:57.960 --> 22:58.480
Right.

459
22:58.480 --> 22:59.160
So tragic.

460
22:59.350 --> 22:59.790
Yeah.

461
22:59.920 --> 23:00.850
But it's just...

462
23:01.480 --> 23:02.880
I'm worried if you can handle it

463
23:02.880 --> 23:03.750
psychologically.

464
23:03.750 --> 23:04.590
Do you feel comfortable

465
23:04.590 --> 23:05.520
playing a ghost?

466
23:05.750 --> 23:06.720
Of course.

467
23:07.110 --> 23:08.170
Very comfortable.

468
23:09.400 --> 23:10.480
Well, right now,

469
23:10.510 --> 23:11.910
I feel like it's nothing.

470
23:14.310 --> 23:15.680
It's all for work.

471
23:15.680 --> 23:17.030
There's no harm in talking about it now.

472
23:17.030 --> 23:18.270
I'm getting more and more used to it.

473
23:18.270 --> 23:19.480
Amazing. Amazing.

474
23:19.480 --> 23:20.720
What a mindset.

475
23:20.720 --> 23:21.440
Right?

476
23:21.440 --> 23:22.110
The key is,

477
23:22.110 --> 23:23.960
his makeup and everything

478
23:23.960 --> 23:24.550
is very authoritative

479
23:24.550 --> 23:25.400
in this field.

480
23:25.680 --> 23:27.310
You invested all the money from selling the house

481
23:27.310 --> 23:28.640
into the haunted house?

482
23:29.640 --> 23:30.770
What haunted house?

483
23:30.830 --> 23:31.270
This is called

484
23:31.270 --> 23:33.880
a mild-horror escape room.

485
23:34.440 --> 23:35.770
What's the difference?

486
23:36.270 --> 23:37.880
You wouldn't understand even if I told you.

487
23:37.880 --> 23:39.030
You have no sense of fun.

488
23:39.030 --> 23:40.480
He doesn't understand

489
23:40.480 --> 23:41.160
this business of young people.

490
23:41.160 --> 23:42.480
Is this place safe?

491
23:42.830 --> 23:43.640
When I just came in,

492
23:43.640 --> 23:45.000
I noticed on the beam,

493
23:45.270 --> 23:46.200
there were a lot of

494
23:46.200 --> 23:47.590
mechanisms stuck to it.

495
23:47.640 --> 23:48.680
Don't let them hit anyone.

496
23:48.680 --> 23:50.200
Don't you trust me?

497
23:50.270 --> 23:52.000
I've got the business license.

498
23:52.350 --> 23:53.920
It's just that there's no heating,

499
23:53.920 --> 23:55.450
so it's a bit cold in winter.

500
23:55.640 --> 23:57.480
Did you find someone for the license?

501
23:57.480 --> 23:59.030
Do you need me to pull some strings?

502
23:59.030 --> 23:59.830
I did.

503
23:59.830 --> 24:00.830
You guys don't know.

504
24:00.830 --> 24:02.680
Director Duan knows a lot of people.

505
24:02.680 --> 24:03.310
In terms of safety,

506
24:03.310 --> 24:04.830
you still need to be careful.

507
24:04.830 --> 24:06.830
Your windows don't even have glass.

508
24:07.550 --> 24:08.480
It's quite cold.

509
24:08.920 --> 24:10.030
Stop it.

510
24:10.070 --> 24:12.000
Don't pretend to know everything.

511
24:12.000 --> 24:12.720
When we open,

512
24:12.720 --> 24:14.270
I'll have everything ready.

513
24:14.270 --> 24:15.480
We'll use the second and third floors

514
24:15.480 --> 24:16.720
and seal the windows.

515
24:17.110 --> 24:18.070
Why don't you let him keep an eye on it

516
24:18.070 --> 24:19.400
during the renovation?

517
24:19.480 --> 24:20.030
You can come.

518
24:20.030 --> 24:21.760
What does it have to do with you?

519
24:23.510 --> 24:24.270
See?

520
24:24.270 --> 24:25.330
This is my brother.

521
24:25.480 --> 24:26.270
No matter what,

522
24:26.270 --> 24:27.400
he always has to argue with me.

523
24:27.400 --> 24:28.200
I can't help it.

524
24:28.200 --> 24:29.730
Our relationship is fixed.

525
24:29.920 --> 24:31.050
It can't be changed.

526
24:31.070 --> 24:32.960
This proves you two have a good relationship.

527
24:32.960 --> 24:34.960
That's why you're like this, right?

528
24:34.960 --> 24:36.070
Behave yourself.

529
24:36.750 --> 24:37.790
Listen to what your brother says.

530
24:37.790 --> 24:38.550
I will.

531
24:39.110 --> 24:40.000
Will you actually listen?

532
24:40.000 --> 24:40.960
He must.

533
24:40.960 --> 24:41.680
No.

534
24:43.000 --> 24:43.720
If you can't,

535
24:43.720 --> 24:45.790
y-you have to listen to me.

536
24:47.070 --> 24:48.270
How are you two doing?

537
24:49.310 --> 24:50.370
About the wedding?

538
24:50.640 --> 24:51.640
Have you set a date?

539
24:51.640 --> 24:52.400
Yes.

540
24:52.440 --> 24:53.310
The 28th.

541
24:54.160 --> 24:55.110
Of this month?

542
24:55.510 --> 24:56.680
That's in a few days.

543
24:56.680 --> 24:57.550
Exactly.

544
24:57.590 --> 24:59.240
Then don't you still have to organize

545
24:59.240 --> 25:00.000
things here?

546
25:00.000 --> 25:01.030
It's such a rush.

547
25:01.070 --> 25:01.680
Well,

548
25:01.680 --> 25:04.010
the wedding company said it's no problem.

549
25:04.030 --> 25:05.110
They can get it done,

550
25:05.110 --> 25:06.240
and get it done well.

551
25:07.240 --> 25:08.110
I figured...

552
25:08.920 --> 25:10.550
We figured

553
25:10.920 --> 25:11.830
we'd better hurry up.

554
25:11.830 --> 25:13.630
You're really good at planning.

555
25:13.680 --> 25:14.920
Can't wait, huh?

556
25:19.270 --> 25:19.960
Yours.

557
25:20.200 --> 25:21.480
Chen. Yours.

558
25:21.480 --> 25:22.960
-What kind of show is this? -A red envelope?

559
25:22.960 --> 25:23.510
When the time comes,

560
25:23.510 --> 25:24.750
you all bring your red envelopes.

561
25:24.750 --> 25:25.680
I'll inspect them.

562
25:25.680 --> 25:26.510
You prepared them?

563
25:26.510 --> 25:28.480
You're getting way too hyped up for someone else's wedding.

564
25:28.480 --> 25:29.410
I'm the best man.

565
25:29.590 --> 25:30.990
If I don't, who will? You?

566
25:31.000 --> 25:33.240
-You're still the matchmaker. -You're still the matchmaker.

567
25:33.240 --> 25:34.070
You're the best.

568
25:34.070 --> 25:35.440
How come you know everything?

569
25:35.440 --> 25:36.480
-A toast to the matchmaker. -Come on.

570
25:36.480 --> 25:38.160
-You're the best. -Come on.

571
25:38.160 --> 25:40.020
Do a good job. Scare them to death.

572
25:44.160 --> 25:46.030
You'll need to hire people for that business.

573
25:46.030 --> 25:47.160
Right, Zhengguang?

574
25:47.720 --> 25:49.200
Yeah, at least three.

575
25:49.590 --> 25:51.270
Can you recover the cost?

576
25:52.270 --> 25:54.330
Haven't calculated it. I don't know.

577
25:54.830 --> 25:56.270
I'm going to Beijing in a while

578
25:56.270 --> 25:57.640
to open a small company.

579
25:58.030 --> 25:59.400
If you have time,

580
26:00.200 --> 26:01.600
come over and help me out.

581
26:01.680 --> 26:02.750
Come on, Junnan.

582
26:02.750 --> 26:03.880
What can I do?

583
26:04.590 --> 26:06.270
Don't be modest.

584
26:06.480 --> 26:07.270
When we went to Beijing,

585
26:07.270 --> 26:09.470
look how well you arranged everything.

586
26:09.550 --> 26:11.030
Nowadays, finding

587
26:11.030 --> 26:12.590
a trustworthy person to cooperate with

588
26:12.590 --> 26:14.400
is really not easy.

589
26:17.310 --> 26:17.960
Forget it.

590
26:18.240 --> 26:18.830
I'd better

591
26:18.830 --> 26:20.090
stay in the Northeast.

592
26:20.110 --> 26:21.310
Quit running around.

593
26:25.030 --> 26:25.830
Zhengliang,

594
26:26.640 --> 26:28.640
give your little brother some advice.

595
26:28.640 --> 26:30.440
Why are you asking him about my business?

596
26:30.440 --> 26:31.310
Isn't he your brother?

597
26:31.310 --> 26:32.350
Brothers should discuss things

598
26:32.350 --> 26:33.960
with each other.

599
26:35.030 --> 26:37.030
Zhengliang, what's your advice?

600
26:37.750 --> 26:38.680
He has no advice.

601
26:41.110 --> 26:42.040
Liu Zhengliang.

602
26:43.400 --> 26:45.200
G-Give Zhengguang some advice.

603
26:47.440 --> 26:48.830
Do you still remember Wang Bao?

604
26:48.830 --> 26:49.550
Who?

605
26:53.510 --> 26:55.270
The coward is having a seizure!

606
26:55.590 --> 26:56.520
Liu Zhengliang!

607
26:57.680 --> 26:59.010
What are you guys doing?

608
27:01.590 --> 27:02.880
Chen Junnan is here! Run!

609
27:02.880 --> 27:04.200
What are you doing?

610
27:05.640 --> 27:06.840
It's okay. It's okay.

611
27:06.920 --> 27:07.980
Safe now. Safe now.

612
27:09.960 --> 27:11.030
I remember now.

613
27:12.030 --> 27:13.200
The one who bullied you back then,

614
27:13.200 --> 27:13.830
right?

615
27:17.000 --> 27:17.930
Who bullied you?

616
27:18.480 --> 27:19.590
No one bullied me.

617
27:19.680 --> 27:21.350
Just playing around. Nonsense.

618
27:21.350 --> 27:22.160
Go back to sleep.

619
27:22.160 --> 27:23.110
Would he dare?

620
27:23.350 --> 27:24.480
What is it, Junnan?

621
27:25.480 --> 27:26.790
About this Wang Bao...

622
27:27.070 --> 27:28.070
Back then,

623
27:28.480 --> 27:29.640
you were still young.

624
27:29.640 --> 27:31.040
You don't remember much.

625
27:40.180 --> 27:46.560
[Emergency]

626
28:02.110 --> 28:03.310
Chief Physician Liu.

627
28:04.590 --> 28:06.120
D-Do you still remember me?

628
28:07.790 --> 28:08.920
Aren't you the patient

629
28:08.920 --> 28:10.520
who came to see me yesterday?

630
28:11.590 --> 28:13.720
We were classmates in primary school.

631
28:13.830 --> 28:14.920
When you came in yesterday,

632
28:14.920 --> 28:16.110
you looked familiar.

633
28:16.110 --> 28:17.510
Later, I went to your department

634
28:17.510 --> 28:18.830
and checked the expert's resume.

635
28:18.830 --> 28:20.230
Then I was sure it was you.

636
28:21.000 --> 28:23.310
I have a deep impression of you.

637
28:25.200 --> 28:26.000
And then?

638
28:28.000 --> 28:29.790
You went to the South later, right?

639
28:29.790 --> 28:32.110
Yes, I just came back recently.

640
28:35.110 --> 28:37.160
Well, I've asked around.

641
28:37.680 --> 28:40.160
You are indeed the most famous expert

642
28:40.510 --> 28:41.970
in my condition right now.

643
28:43.440 --> 28:44.310
I want to say...

644
28:50.790 --> 28:53.720
I am a good teacher now.

645
28:55.440 --> 28:56.770
I teach very seriously.

646
28:57.880 --> 28:59.030
My students

647
28:59.030 --> 29:00.550
also like me very much.

648
29:02.920 --> 29:04.450
Why are you telling me this?

649
29:11.640 --> 29:12.440
I...

650
29:15.310 --> 29:16.770
I want to have the surgery.

651
29:19.310 --> 29:21.570
You will try your best to treat me, right?

652
29:21.790 --> 29:22.550
Of course.

653
29:23.350 --> 29:23.960
You are the patient,

654
29:23.960 --> 29:25.020
and I am the doctor.

655
29:25.480 --> 29:26.590
I will do my best

656
29:26.590 --> 29:27.650
for every patient.

657
29:33.110 --> 29:33.960
That's good.

658
29:37.270 --> 29:38.270
Then... alright,

659
29:38.350 --> 29:39.310
I don't have anything else.

660
29:39.310 --> 29:40.640
You can get back to work.

661
29:47.530 --> 29:51.220
[Emergency]

662
29:56.030 --> 29:56.680
Dad.

663
29:57.110 --> 29:58.640
You look so energetic.

664
29:58.640 --> 29:59.700
It's our birthday.

665
29:59.880 --> 30:00.720
I have to dress up

666
30:00.720 --> 30:02.000
neatly.

667
30:02.720 --> 30:04.200
The dishes are almost ready.

668
30:04.200 --> 30:05.830
Only the longevity noodles are left.

669
30:05.830 --> 30:06.640
Okay.

670
30:14.830 --> 30:15.400
Junnan.

671
30:15.400 --> 30:15.880
Uncle Che.

672
30:15.880 --> 30:16.880
Come in, come in.

673
30:18.350 --> 30:19.030
Happy birthday.

674
30:19.030 --> 30:20.640
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.

675
30:20.640 --> 30:21.700
Where is Mingming?

676
30:22.070 --> 30:23.400
She's cooking noodles.

677
30:25.000 --> 30:26.860
You even brought gifts. This kid.

678
30:27.160 --> 30:27.920
Mingming.

679
30:29.000 --> 30:29.930
Happy birthday.

680
30:31.110 --> 30:31.920
Thank you.

681
30:34.030 --> 30:35.720
How did you know it's our birthday?

682
30:35.720 --> 30:36.400
When Uncle Che and I

683
30:36.400 --> 30:37.920
checked in in Beijing,

684
30:38.310 --> 30:39.680
it was written on the ID card.

685
30:39.680 --> 30:40.610
I remembered it.

686
30:40.680 --> 30:41.680
Nonsense.

687
30:42.240 --> 30:43.350
Didn't I tell you that

688
30:43.350 --> 30:44.680
Mingming and I share the same birthday?

689
30:44.680 --> 30:45.550
You forgot?

690
30:47.030 --> 30:47.830
Yes.

691
30:53.830 --> 30:54.640
The key.

692
31:08.240 --> 31:09.070
Junnan.

693
31:10.510 --> 31:13.270
This key is very good.

694
31:14.270 --> 31:15.640
He's so thoughtful.

695
31:16.880 --> 31:17.790
With such a good cake,

696
31:17.790 --> 31:19.440
should we make a wish?

697
31:19.480 --> 31:20.810
-Make a wish. -Go ahead.

698
31:23.510 --> 31:26.160
I hope I, Che Changhai,

699
31:27.350 --> 31:28.680
my daughter Mingming,

700
31:30.510 --> 31:32.110
and of course, our Junnan,

701
31:32.640 --> 31:34.350
will all be healthy

702
31:34.880 --> 31:36.140
and have a smooth life.

703
31:36.720 --> 31:38.400
Especially Mingming

704
31:39.240 --> 31:40.510
and our Junnan.

705
31:41.160 --> 31:42.350
Both young.

706
31:44.110 --> 31:46.510
Be open and bold in what you do.

707
31:47.480 --> 31:48.810
Whatever comes to mind,

708
31:49.880 --> 31:50.640
don't hesitate.

709
31:50.640 --> 31:51.550
Just go for it.

710
31:51.550 --> 31:53.810
-Do it bravely. -The cake will get soggy.

711
31:53.830 --> 31:55.890
I haven't finished making my wishes.

712
31:56.070 --> 31:56.880
Do it bravely.

713
31:56.880 --> 31:58.340
You can achieve anything.

714
31:59.750 --> 32:00.550
Alright.

715
32:01.880 --> 32:02.810
Did I say it well?

716
32:03.000 --> 32:04.400
May your dreams come true

717
32:04.720 --> 32:06.380
and your wishes be fulfilled.

718
32:19.480 --> 32:20.270
Are you done?

719
32:20.720 --> 32:22.380
What did you wish for? Tell us.

720
32:23.270 --> 32:24.440
I hope...

721
32:25.070 --> 32:27.270
my dad stays healthy.

722
32:28.270 --> 32:29.110
I hope

723
32:29.200 --> 32:30.880
my dad and I

724
32:31.000 --> 32:32.330
will have a better life.

725
32:32.960 --> 32:34.030
I hope

726
32:35.030 --> 32:36.690
I can get into the PhD program.

727
32:38.350 --> 32:39.160
That's it?

728
32:40.110 --> 32:40.960
That's it?

729
32:41.960 --> 32:42.820
That's enough.

730
32:43.750 --> 32:44.680
Don't you think

731
32:44.680 --> 32:45.550
something is missing?

732
32:45.550 --> 32:46.750
Blow out the candles.

733
32:47.270 --> 32:48.070
Okay.

734
32:48.750 --> 32:49.960
One, two, three.

735
32:52.400 --> 32:53.640
Happy birthday!

736
32:54.640 --> 32:55.880
Thank you. That's very thoughtful.

737
32:55.880 --> 32:57.510
Taking this opportunity

738
32:57.510 --> 32:58.790
of your birthdays,

739
33:00.110 --> 33:01.960
c-can I say a few words?

740
33:02.400 --> 33:03.200
Go ahead.

741
33:05.830 --> 33:06.920
I hope

742
33:08.240 --> 33:09.720
I can be

743
33:11.440 --> 33:12.880
braver in the future.

744
33:14.030 --> 33:15.000
Sometimes,

745
33:15.680 --> 33:18.270
well, I tend to hide.

746
33:18.310 --> 33:19.480
When I encounter something,

747
33:19.480 --> 33:21.030
thinking about the result

748
33:21.030 --> 33:22.350
makes me want to give up.

749
33:22.350 --> 33:23.000
Right.

750
33:26.110 --> 33:26.960
But

751
33:28.110 --> 33:29.920
I finally found something

752
33:30.400 --> 33:32.790
that I can't let go of,

753
33:33.960 --> 33:35.880
no matter how many times I fail.

754
33:37.160 --> 33:38.310
I mean...

755
33:39.960 --> 33:41.350
no matter what the future holds,

756
33:41.350 --> 33:43.070
I will keep going.

757
33:43.310 --> 33:44.970
Do you understand, Mingming?

758
33:46.680 --> 33:48.000
You're talking about yourself.

759
33:48.000 --> 33:49.660
What does it have to do with me?

760
33:49.920 --> 33:51.680
Right, I'm talking about myself.

761
33:51.680 --> 33:53.270
I just want to say

762
33:53.270 --> 33:53.920
that no matter

763
33:53.920 --> 33:55.310
what difficulties I encounter,

764
33:55.310 --> 33:56.310
I won't give up—

765
33:56.310 --> 33:57.110
Chen Junnan.

766
33:57.920 --> 33:59.520
Aren't you going to Beijing?

767
33:59.880 --> 34:01.200
Beijing is quite far.

768
34:01.200 --> 34:01.720
Don't keep worrying

769
34:01.720 --> 34:02.790
about things here.

770
34:03.110 --> 34:04.270
Just settle down there

771
34:04.270 --> 34:05.480
and work hard.

772
34:05.640 --> 34:07.640
You finally got the chance to go out.

773
34:10.190 --> 34:12.320
Junnan, you're going to Beijing?

774
34:12.840 --> 34:14.639
You won't care about me anymore?

775
34:16.070 --> 34:16.880
I will.

776
34:17.760 --> 34:18.550
Well...

777
34:36.110 --> 34:36.880
Are you done?

778
34:37.110 --> 34:37.960
Almost.

779
34:38.230 --> 34:40.880
Let me put on the headpiece.

780
34:42.320 --> 34:43.110
Does it hurt?

781
34:43.110 --> 34:43.840
No.

782
34:48.190 --> 34:49.110
This one.

783
34:49.230 --> 34:51.110
Do I look good like this?

784
34:52.440 --> 34:53.760
Very pretty.

785
34:54.280 --> 34:55.880
Let me tell you,

786
34:56.190 --> 34:57.070
you are the most beautiful bride

787
34:57.070 --> 34:58.880
I have ever seen.

788
35:03.110 --> 35:03.880
Chen.

789
35:04.480 --> 35:05.960
How are things between you and Dr. Liu?

790
35:05.960 --> 35:07.360
Any plans to get married?

791
35:07.880 --> 35:08.590
Us?

792
35:08.590 --> 35:09.360
We...

793
35:10.840 --> 35:12.500
haven't been dating for long.

794
35:13.590 --> 35:14.520
There's no rush.

795
35:15.800 --> 35:17.600
I haven't even thought about it.

796
35:18.110 --> 35:19.440
Although I can't see,

797
35:19.840 --> 35:21.280
my hearing's just fine.

798
35:21.280 --> 35:22.030
Really?

799
35:22.190 --> 35:24.590
I can tell you've thought about it just by listening.

800
35:24.590 --> 35:25.670
Are you that good?

801
35:28.880 --> 35:30.110
Then I'll wait

802
35:30.440 --> 35:31.960
until this winter is over.

803
35:34.440 --> 35:35.230
Chen.

804
35:36.840 --> 35:38.550
I went blind in the winter.

805
35:40.110 --> 35:41.510
But I always believe

806
35:42.440 --> 35:43.400
that I'll definitely see

807
35:43.400 --> 35:44.460
spring come again.

808
35:47.440 --> 35:48.480
Spring will come.

809
35:49.320 --> 35:50.030
Right?

810
35:51.670 --> 35:52.590
Of course.

811
35:54.440 --> 35:56.070
Spring will always come.

812
36:32.230 --> 36:33.320
Are you nervous?

813
36:34.070 --> 36:34.880
No.

814
36:35.710 --> 36:37.150
I'm talking to Xiaozhu.

815
36:38.400 --> 36:39.190
Me?

816
36:40.000 --> 36:40.800
A little.

817
36:41.550 --> 36:42.360
Isn't this

818
36:42.510 --> 36:44.710
my first time driving the wedding lead car?

819
36:44.710 --> 36:45.920
I'm not used to it.

820
36:46.510 --> 36:47.510
Don't be nervous.

821
36:47.840 --> 36:49.480
Isn't it the first time for all of us?

822
36:49.480 --> 36:50.150
Yes.

823
36:50.230 --> 36:51.590
It'll be better next time.

824
36:51.590 --> 36:53.120
What are you talking about?

825
36:53.480 --> 36:54.670
I'm just kidding.

826
36:54.960 --> 36:56.220
You scared me to death.

827
36:56.960 --> 36:57.670
Now all three of us

828
36:57.670 --> 36:59.320
aren't nervous anymore, right?

829
36:59.320 --> 37:00.480
This is my only time.

830
37:00.880 --> 37:02.070
This is my only time too.

831
37:02.070 --> 37:03.590
Okay, I'll get married next time.

832
37:03.590 --> 37:05.150
Can you follow closer?

833
37:05.590 --> 37:07.150
We are a convoy.

834
37:07.510 --> 37:08.590
Are you waiting for someone to cut in?

835
37:08.590 --> 37:10.070
Don't be so modest.

836
37:11.550 --> 37:12.360
What?

837
37:13.670 --> 37:15.070
What are you laughing at?

838
37:15.070 --> 37:17.760
Well, I was imagining a future

839
37:17.760 --> 37:20.000
with you and Liu Zhengliang in the car.

840
37:20.000 --> 37:20.960
He'll be driving,

841
37:20.960 --> 37:21.800
and you'll be in the passenger seat.

842
37:21.800 --> 37:22.320
Then, Chen,

843
37:22.320 --> 37:24.110
you'll be guessing at directions.

844
37:24.110 --> 37:25.760
And then...

845
37:25.760 --> 37:26.480
I'll be guessing at directions?

846
37:26.480 --> 37:27.230
You two will argue,

847
37:27.230 --> 37:28.190
and he'll ignore you.

848
37:28.190 --> 37:28.880
Then you will

849
37:28.880 --> 37:29.710
start yelling again, Chen.

850
37:29.710 --> 37:31.960
The scene will be too funny.

851
37:32.000 --> 37:32.960
Come on.

852
37:32.960 --> 37:35.020
Do you think your brother is like you?

853
37:35.190 --> 37:36.990
He's got a good laugh out of this.

854
37:37.110 --> 37:38.000
Chen, Chen.

855
37:38.000 --> 37:38.440
What?

856
37:38.440 --> 37:40.070
Isn't Chief Physician Liu coming

857
37:40.070 --> 37:40.880
today?

858
37:41.070 --> 37:42.870
Uncle Gong, I forgot to tell you.

859
37:43.070 --> 37:45.440
He can't make it because of the surgery today.

860
37:45.440 --> 37:47.100
Life and death are important.

861
37:47.880 --> 37:49.410
Saving lives is important.

862
37:49.670 --> 37:50.730
My in-law is right.

863
37:52.960 --> 37:56.190
Please exchange rings.

864
37:57.480 --> 37:58.280
Rings.

865
37:59.360 --> 38:01.190
Wear this promise

866
38:01.670 --> 38:03.960
firmly on each other's...

867
38:04.550 --> 38:06.880
Firmly on each other's...

868
38:06.880 --> 38:07.880
Let's go, come on.

869
38:09.800 --> 38:10.550
No rush.

870
38:11.440 --> 38:13.360
Everything is under control—

871
38:13.360 --> 38:14.550
Stop dawdling.

872
38:14.550 --> 38:15.800
We'll be late.

873
38:16.590 --> 38:17.400
Amy.

874
38:18.630 --> 38:20.400
You look beautiful today.

875
38:21.230 --> 38:22.150
Thank you.

876
38:23.510 --> 38:24.320
Yes.

877
38:24.760 --> 38:26.630
I remember when we got married,

878
38:27.760 --> 38:29.030
I only had 50 yuan.

879
38:30.800 --> 38:32.430
I borrowed 50 from Li

880
38:34.230 --> 38:36.000
and 50 from my dad,

881
38:37.030 --> 38:38.320
and scraped together 150

882
38:38.320 --> 38:40.000
to hold the wedding.

883
38:41.110 --> 38:44.000
Let's go reminisce in the car.

884
38:47.360 --> 38:48.360
I was thinking,

885
38:49.670 --> 38:50.550
should we

886
38:50.550 --> 38:53.000
get a pair of wedding rings?

887
38:54.590 --> 38:55.400
Okay.

888
38:56.440 --> 38:57.710
I'll steal one for you tomorrow.

889
38:57.710 --> 38:58.510
Amy.

890
39:00.670 --> 39:02.440
I'm just kidding.

891
39:03.320 --> 39:04.150
I'll buy one.

892
39:05.190 --> 39:07.320
You can get whatever kind you want.

893
39:07.510 --> 39:09.840
Then I'll have to pick carefully.

894
39:33.400 --> 39:34.920
What, are you nervous?

895
39:38.630 --> 39:39.560
Liu Zhengliang.

896
39:41.070 --> 39:43.200
You won't take revenge on me, will you?

897
39:43.480 --> 39:45.880
Maybe you should cut back on horror movies.

898
39:47.510 --> 39:48.320
Then why didn't you

899
39:48.320 --> 39:49.630
accept the gift my wife sent?

900
39:49.630 --> 39:50.960
The hospital has rules.

901
39:50.960 --> 39:53.020
We can't accept gifts from patients.

902
39:58.880 --> 40:00.410
We were too young back then.

903
40:01.110 --> 40:02.510
We didn't know anything.

904
40:06.400 --> 40:08.110
I knew you remembered.

905
40:08.320 --> 40:09.650
Don't you remember too?

906
40:11.320 --> 40:12.720
But I don't care anymore.

907
40:13.000 --> 40:13.800
Really?

908
40:13.920 --> 40:14.710
Really.

909
40:16.150 --> 40:16.960
Marker.

910
40:31.230 --> 40:32.470
When I'm in class,

911
40:34.710 --> 40:36.400
I often tell my students

912
40:38.710 --> 40:40.510
not to bully their classmates.

913
40:44.760 --> 40:46.150
Whenever I say this,

914
40:47.800 --> 40:49.150
I always think of you.

915
40:58.440 --> 40:59.510
Today, my life

916
41:01.110 --> 41:02.320
is in your hands.

917
41:03.360 --> 41:04.150
What,

918
41:04.960 --> 41:06.420
do you regret coming to me?

919
41:06.840 --> 41:08.070
I didn't mean that.

920
41:09.070 --> 41:11.510
You are lying on the operating table now.

921
41:13.070 --> 41:14.280
You are my patient,

922
41:14.590 --> 41:15.510
not my enemy.

923
41:18.030 --> 41:19.090
Did you offend him?

924
41:20.920 --> 41:21.760
It's okay.

925
41:22.320 --> 41:23.840
Chief Physician Liu doesn't hold grudges.

926
41:23.840 --> 41:24.960
Before, a patient took a knife

927
41:24.960 --> 41:26.090
and almost hurt him,

928
41:26.150 --> 41:27.750
but he still operated on him.

929
41:32.750 --> 41:34.710
It seems you really are a good doctor.

930
41:34.710 --> 41:35.440
Don't you also consider yourself

931
41:35.440 --> 41:36.550
a good teacher?

932
41:37.150 --> 41:38.810
Since we are both good people,

933
41:39.760 --> 41:41.280
can we start the surgery?

934
41:56.110 --> 41:57.960
Anesthesiologist, wake the patient.

935
41:57.960 --> 41:59.420
Yes, Chief Physician Liu.

936
42:02.150 --> 42:02.960
Wang Bao.

937
42:05.280 --> 42:06.680
Can you hear me, Wang Bao?

938
42:08.480 --> 42:09.280
Wang Bao?

939
42:14.280 --> 42:16.480
Do you remember what you do for a living?

940
42:18.280 --> 42:19.070
Wang Bao?

941
42:22.710 --> 42:24.280
Wang Bao, can you hear me?

942
42:25.150 --> 42:27.010
Speak if you can hear me, Wang Bao.

943
42:27.320 --> 42:29.070
Anesthesiologist, what's going on?

944
42:29.070 --> 42:30.510
Is the dosage too high?

945
42:30.710 --> 42:32.150
The patient is not conscious.

946
42:32.150 --> 42:33.760
There shouldn't be any problem, Chief Physician Liu.

947
42:33.760 --> 42:35.690
Maybe the drug metabolism is slow.

948
42:36.150 --> 42:38.440
Or let's wait a bit longer.

949
42:38.710 --> 42:41.110
Wang Bao, can you hear me?

950
42:45.960 --> 42:47.150
I can hear you.

951
42:48.280 --> 42:50.110
Good, as long as you can hear me.

952
42:54.920 --> 42:55.850
Liu Zhengliang.

953
43:00.150 --> 43:01.030
I'm sorry.

954
43:05.590 --> 43:06.480
It's okay.

955
43:07.480 --> 43:08.070
Yang Ran,

956
43:08.070 --> 43:09.630
prepare for the language function test.

957
43:09.630 --> 43:10.230
Okay.

958
43:10.360 --> 43:11.360
Pass the cortical stimulator.

959
43:11.360 --> 43:11.800
Okay.
